## Monitoring & Metrics

All requests include tracking metadata:

```typescript
{
  metrics: {
    requestId: 'uuid',
    timestamp: 'ISO string',
    latencyMs: 1523,
    tokensEstimated: 125,
  },
  routeDecision: {
    fallbackUsed: false, // Was a fallback used?
    confidence: 0.95, // How confident in this routing?
  }
}
```

### Performance Targets

| Metric | Target | Current |
|--------|--------|---------|
| First token (fast model) | <500ms | ~500ms |
| First token (premium model) | <2000ms | ~1500ms |
| Fallback activation | <5s total | TBD |
| Health check interval | 30s | ✓ Implemented |

## Troubleshooting

### "No suitable model found" error
- Check tier configuration in database
- Verify all provider API keys are valid
- Review `DEFAULT_MODELS` catalog in `router-engine.ts`

### High fallback rate
- Check provider health with `getHealthStatus()`
- Reduce failure threshold or increase API quotas
- Consider adding more provider variants

### Intent misclassification
- Add new patterns to `INTENT_PATTERNS` array
- Adjust priority values (higher = stronger match)
- Enable verbose logging in dev mode

